Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.74,0:01:21.50,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}送
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.79,0:01:21.55,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1023.396,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}著
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:00.50,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,--14--
